          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samisoni watambikili Yehova, nindi, Eyi Mwanta Yehova, ŋanakeni mwani, ankoleshi mwani, aka kamu hohu, eyi Nzambi, kulonda niditendihadi aFwilistinu hohenahanu namesu ami ayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samisoni wakwatilihayishimi yiyedi yakoleleli itala, washindamenenuku, chishimi chimuna chikasa chachidiilu, chikwawu nachikasa chachimunswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samisoni welili nindi, Nifwili kwami hamu nawaFwilistinu. Wabandamini naŋovuyindi yejima; itala dishiwukila nianyanta niantu ejima adiŋumu. Nochulŋahiliyi hachidiŋiyi mumi akeheli; aswejeli kuvula ajahiliyi hafwiliyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
