          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niana kwindini ejima akumutaŋa watata yindi ayiluku, amunyamwini, amutweli nakumujiika kuneli Zora iku, Eshetawoli iku, hakachi, hohamujiikilu wutata yindi Manowa. Wayihosheleli aIsarela nyiloŋa yawu nyakamakumi ayedi.",
          "type": "text",
